<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - USG Corp started as a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - USG Corp started as a buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dillon, Read &amp; Co Inc said it initiated coverage of USG Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-18 month price target of $45 a share.</p>
<p>-- expects USG to earn $5.05 a share in fiscal 1997 and $5.30 in fiscal 1998.</p>
<p>-- USG was up 1/2 to 34-1/4.</p>
</text>
